The generated source profile shall retain ordered signed scalar fields for bounded PULSE, SIN, PWL and EXP forms, with independent optional DC and AC clauses in qualified orders. Duplicate clauses, unknown profiles and unsupported scalar shapes shall refuse atomically. Selected static preparation shall evaluate fields in the active instance environment, use an explicit DC value when supplied and otherwise the qualified waveform value at time zero, and preserve waveform metadata for a later explicit transient operation. Waveform metadata omissions shall never erase physical source cards from the independent native projection.
<<<
