Implementation: SpiceParser sourceClause/waveformExcitation, SourceProfileExtraction, SourceWaveformPreparation and OperatingPointBridge.SourceWaveforms. Qualified static forms: PULSE2-7 fields, SIN2-6, EXP2-6, and ordered nonnegative PWL pairs under the existing256-token semantic-entry bound. Negative delays and extra fields remain unsupported. Timing defaults are not invented during DC preparation. Verification: SourceWaveformTests,64 FsCheck clause-order cases (replay929,20261103), malformed profiles, reserved-keyword tests and original-source native fixtures. Evidence: evidence/corpus-waveform-results.json. Draft pending wider waveform/default qualification.
