[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SEM-TRANSIENT-SELECT-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Explicit transient selection reusing the existing waveform runtime
STATEMENT: >>>
The frontend shall expose an explicit bounded transient operation over the prepared circuit, mapping retained waveform fields to existing typed runtime source overrides with seconds, hertz and radian conventions. Stop/step-dependent defaults shall be named and evaluated from the requested analysis, not an unexecuted original command. Unsupported runtime profiles, mismatched explicit DC and waveform initialization, invalid budgets and source-count excess shall return structured atomic refusals. Original analysis/control omissions shall remain auditable and must not be presented as full-program execution.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Implementation: TransientSelection and Client Pulse/DampedSine/Exponential DTOs, existing Rust configured integration/BoundSources/Waveform. Backward Euler only in this operation; source-count128, existing bridge limits, step count<=100000. Defaults follow pinned ngspice vsrcload.c, including the five-field pulse zero-width case. Overlapping pulse edges or distinct declared DC/time-zero bias are explicitly unsupported rather than silently modified. Negative damping/frequency and invalid exponential delays/time constants refuse. Verification: TransientSelectionTests, native waveform/control fixtures and refinement comparisons. Evidence: evidence/corpus-waveform-results.json and subsequent current/transient reference evidence. Draft, not general transient or UIC qualification.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SEM-WAVE-SOURCE-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SEM-WAVE-SINE-INITIAL-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Delayed sinusoid phase consistency at initialization
STATEMENT: >>>
A delayed sinusoidal source shall hold offset plus amplitude times sine of its phase before its delay, including transient time zero, and continue from that same value at the delay boundary before subsequent damping/oscillation. Voltage and current source quantities shall share this waveform law. Static source preparation and configured initialization shall not silently disagree on this initial excitation.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Implementation: src/waveform.rs DampedSine and SourceWaveformPreparation. Independent primary reference: pinned ngspice vsrcload.c SINE path uses VO+VA*sin(PHASE) for time<=TD. Historical importer regression wrongly expected offset alone; updated with the independently observed value. Verification: delayed-phase red request (old Rust0V versus native1V), ngspice_compat pre-delay/boundary assertions, native voltage/current fixtures and selected transient comparisons. Evidence: evidence/corpus-waveform-results.json and raw replay request/log fingerprints. Draft pending broader waveform qualification.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SEM-WAVE-SOURCE-001

