Selected transient qualification shall compare named voltage and signed branch-current observables against original-source ngspice and an independently identified managed reference when available. Units, initialization, control loading, integration method, common grid, interpolation, numerical bounds and timestep refinement shall be explicit. Missing probes, invalid traces, identity changes, unavailable references and numerical discrepancies shall not be treated as passes. Refinement observations shall not be claimed as a global accuracy proof.
