Implementation: TransientSelection and the existing typed PWL wire profile. Reference behavior: ngspice vsrcload.c and isrcload.c wrap only after the period. Verification: TransientSelectionTests and the original tests/general/rc.cir replay. Source waveform agreement and RC integration accuracy are separate criteria.
