[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FRONTEND-RESISTOR-ARRAY-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Requested resistor instance conductance and memoryless sine startup
STATEMENT: >>>
For requested scalar, constant-model and sheet-model resistors, a single positive finite M and SCALE assignment shall scale both DC and AC conductance as M / (R * SCALE). An AC assignment shall replace only the small-signal resistance. Exact zero effective sheet width with positive effective length and explicit positive AC resistance shall give zero DC and transient conductance. Negative effective geometry, duplicates and invalid physical values shall refuse. A requested memoryless linear SIN transient may initialize from its waveform while a separate operating point uses the declared DC source.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Generated assignment ranges feed ResistorModelLowering. OperatingPointBridge uses an exact zero-conductance stamp for the open sheet case and RequestedAnalysis replaces it only for linear AC. TransientSelection admits distinct sine startup only for the bounded memoryless profile. Native references are ngspice restemp.c, resload.c and the original tests/resistance/res_array.cir. Verification uses RequestedAnalysisTests and evidence/grammar-cohort-checklist.md.
<<<
